        "liquid": "<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: stretch;\">\n  <div>\n    <h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\" class=\"heading h2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding-top: 0px;\">WE SOLD OUT.</h3>\n<h3 class=\"heading h2\" style=\"margin-top: 2px; color: #1491D9\">THE NEXT DROP IS BIGGER.</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Demand outran supply. Every starter kit gone. While we restock and rebuild the entire Brisa experience, the waitlist is forming below-first in, first served.</p>\n<a style=\"width: 100%\" class=\"home_button\" href=\"#join\">JOIN THE WAITLIST</a>\n  </div>\n</div>",
