      "name": "Stop Paying",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "",
        "liquid": "<style>\n\n.three-column-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n  gap: 0rem;\n}\n.three-column-grid.row2 p {\n  color: black !important;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n\n.row2 > :nth-child(2) img {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -22px;\n    top: 00px;\n    min-width: 42px;\n    z-index: 3;\n}\n\n\n@media (min-width: 768px) {\n.three-column-grid.row2 p {\n    color: black !important;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n\n}\n.row2 > :nth-child(2) img {\nleft: -25px;\n    min-width: 50px;\n\n}\n}\n\n\n\n  .grid-column {\n    padding: 0rem;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n  }\n\n.three-column-grid.top-price {\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n \n\n \n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .three-column-grid {\n      gap: 0rem;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0;\">\n\n<h2 class=\"heading h2\">STOP PAYING FOR THE SAME HABIT AGAIN AND AGAIN\n\n</h2>\n\n<p>Buy the device once, keep it, and only replace the cores when needed.\n</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"three-column-grid top-price\">\n  <div class=\"grid-column top\">\n$300+ /Mo\n</div><div class=\"griatd-column icons\">\n&nbsp;\n</div><div class=\"grid-column icons\">\n$130. Once\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"three-column-grid row2\">\n  <div class=\"grid-column icons\">\n    <h4 style=\"line-height: 1.2\">WHAT YOU'RE SPENDING NOW</h4>\n<p>\n12 months vaping<br>\n= $4,680</p>\n<p>12 months smoking<br>\n= $6,000 +</p>\n<p>Still damaging your health \n</p>\n<p> Still draining your wallet\n</p>\n<p>Ticking time bomb</p>\n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid-column\">\n<img src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/black-tran.png?v=1772367343\">\n    \n  </div>\n<div class=\"grid-column\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/brisa-better.png?v=1772423446\">\n<p>\nMetal reusable device- built to last\n</p><p>\n9 cores included in starter kit (27 days)\n</p><p>\nCleaning kit\n</p><p>\nCarry bag\n</p><p>\n$45/month for new cores \n</p>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>For less than 2 weeks of your old habit’s cost, it could all be over for good.</p>",
